                <end-time>00:09:10,950</end-time>
                <translation>在我看来</translation>
                <original>なというふうに思っていて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="178" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:10,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:11,962</end-time>
                <translation>在这样的场景中</translation>
                <original>そうした場面で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="179" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:11,962</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:15,975</end-time>
                <translation>我想 “先駆”也对个体来说显而易见了</translation>
                <original>もう先駆が際立って見えてくるということもあると思いますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="180" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:15,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:18,100</end-time>
                <translation>不过 我想到一个问题</translation>
                <original>でも一つ思うんですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="181" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:18,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:23,500</end-time>
                <translation>在上回中讲到 我们因为面对自己会感到不安 </translation>
                <original>前回までに私たちは自分自身と向かい合うと不安になるから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="182" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:23,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:27,850</end-time>
                <translation>所以会被“世人”支配 会去察言观色嘛？</translation>
                <original>だから世人に支配されて空気を読んじゃうんだって教わりましたよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="183" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:27,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:29,446</end-time>
                <translation>明明很容易就会感到不安 </translation>
                <original>すぐに不安になるのに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="184" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:29,446</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:31,220</end-time>
                <translation>但面对自己可能会死这件事 </translation>
                <original>自分が死ぬかもしれないという</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="185" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:31,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:33,275</end-time>
                <translation>也就是面对死亡 真的能做到吗？</translation>
                <original>死と向き合うことっていうのはできるんですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="186" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:33,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:36,360</end-time>
                <translation>您说得对 这确实非常困难 </translation>
                <original>おっしゃる通りそれはとても難しいこと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="187" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:36,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:38,200</end-time>
                <translation>并非易事</translation>
                <original>簡単ではないことですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="188" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:38,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:40,750</end-time>
                <translation>海德格尔认为 为了能够“先驱” </translation>
                <original>私たちが先駆できるためには</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="189" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:40,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:43,400</end-time>
                <translation>对于随之而来的不安 </translation>
                <original>そこに伴う不安に対して</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="190" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:43,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:48,450</end-time>
                <translation>我们需要对此采取某种特别的态度</translation>
                <original>何らかの特別な態度を取る必要があるとハイデガーは考えていました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="191" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:48,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:50,667</end-time>
                <translation>他给出的关键就是</translation>
                <original>その鍵として彼が示すのが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="192" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:50,667</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:54,175</end-time>
                <translation>第2个关键词 “良心的呼唤”</translation>
                <original>第二のキーワードである良心の呼び声です</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="193" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:54,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:57,325</end-time>
                <translation>为了承担责任活下去的第2个关键词 </translation>
                <original>責任を取って生きていくための二つ目のキーワードは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="194" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:09:57,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:00,275</end-time>
                <translation>就是这里的“良心的呼唤”</translation>
                <original>こちらの良心の呼び声なんですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="195" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:00,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:02,012</end-time>
                <translation>首先 这个“良心” </translation>
                <original>まずこの良心というのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="196" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:02,012</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:03,180</end-time>
                <translation>和遭到“良心的谴责”
良心の過酌とか</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="197" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:03,180</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:05,125</end-time>
                <translation>和那种情况下的“良心”是一样的吗？</translation>
                <original>ああいう時の良心と同じですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="198" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:05,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:08,200</end-time>
                <translation>基本上可以说是相同的东西</translation>
                <original>基本的には同じものだと言えると思います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="199" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:08,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:11,825</end-time>
                <translation>比如说 当我们看到一个迷路的人 </translation>
                <original>例えばですね道に迷っている人がいて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="200" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:11,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:13,900</end-time>
                <translation>而自己有要紧事</translation>
                <original>何か自分に用事があって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="201" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:13,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:16,450</end-time>
                <translation>就视而不见地走过去之后 </translation>
                <original>それを無視して素通りしてしまった時に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="202" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:16,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:20,300</end-time>
                <translation>往往事后会感到后悔 大家想必都遇到过</translation>
                <original>後になってから後悔することが人間にはあると思います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="203" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:20,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:25,675</end-time>
                <translation>让我们感觉受到责备的 就是良心</translation>
                <original>そうした時に私を咎めているように感じるものが良心です</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="204" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:25,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:27,840</end-time>
                <translation>虽然会反驳它“不 是因为我有事 没办法啊” </translation>
                <original>いや用事があったんだからしょうがなかったんだと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="205" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:27,840</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:30,400</end-time>
                <translation>但良心的谴责并不会因此停止</translation>
                <original>自分に言い訳をするわけなんですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="206" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:30,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:34,450</end-time>
                <translation>“良心的谴责”不会因为这些理由停止</translation>
                <original>良心の過酌はそうしたことをしても止まないわけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="207" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:34,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:38,020</end-time>
                <translation>良心会说 难道我不会有别的方式么？</translation>
                <original>良心はいや私には別のこともできたんじゃないかと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="208" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:38,020</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:39,875</end-time>
                <translation>难道就没有其他的可能性吗？</translation>
                <original>違う可能性もあったんじゃないかと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="209" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:39,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:43,150</end-time>
                <translation>它会持续地向我发出这样的质问</translation>
                <original>と私に訴えかけ続けるわけです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="210" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:43,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:46,050</end-time>
                <translation>海德格尔不把它看作单纯的声音</translation>
                <original>ハイデガーは単なる声ではなくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="211" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:46,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:48,450</end-time>
                <translation>而是称之为“呼唤”</translation>
                <original>呼び声というふうに呼んでいます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="212" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:48,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:50,560</end-time>
                <translation>就像是被人喊“喂”一样的感觉</translation>
                <original>おいと呼んでくる感じですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="213" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:50,560</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:54,175</end-time>
                <translation>他将其理解为一种唤醒人的声音</translation>
                <original>覚醒させるような声として捉えていました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="214" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:54,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:55,640</end-time>
                <translation>这也和命令有点不同呢</translation>
                <original>命令ともちょっと違いますもんね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="215" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:55,640</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:56,525</end-time>
                <translation>因为是呼唤嘛</translation>
                <original>呼び声ですもんね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="216" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:56,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:58,680</end-time>
                <translation>应该说是召唤吧？</translation>
                <original>まあ呼びかけなんですかね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="217" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:10:58,680</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:01,600</end-time>
                <translation>把睡着的人叫醒的感觉</translation>
                <original>眠っている人を起こすようなイメージですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="218" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:01,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:02,880</end-time>
                <translation>对于那个找借口为自己开脱 </translation>
                <original>自分に言い訳をして</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="219" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:02,880</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:03,807</end-time>
                <translation>说着“不 这是没办法的事”</translation>
                <original>いやしょうがなかったんだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="220" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:03,807</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:04,775</end-time>
                <translation>说着“这是没办法的事”</translation>
                <original>しょうがなかったんだと言って</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="221" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:04,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:06,440</end-time>
                <translation>试图逃避的自己 </translation>
                <original>逃れようとしているのを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="222" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:06,440</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:07,925</end-time>
                <translation>它用一种“喂、喂、喂”的感觉 </translation>
                <original>おいおいおいっていう感じで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="223" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:07,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:10,875</end-time>
                <translation>发出唤醒的声音</translation>
