            </t>
            <t index="241" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:51,755</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:53,950</end-time>
                <translation>想要就此走过的时候</translation>
                <original>一歩通り過ぎようとするときの</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="242" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:53,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:11:59,550</end-time>
                <translation>那种心里一紧的感觉吧</translation>
                <original>ざわっていうあの感じかしら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="243" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:11:59,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:02,999</end-time>
                <translation>发出良心呼唤的</translation>
                <original>良心の呼び声を発するのも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="244" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:02,999</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:05,400</end-time>
                <translation>和被呼唤的 都是自己</translation>
                <original>呼びかけられるのも自分です</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="245" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:06,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:08,705</end-time>
                <translation>被呼唤的</translation>
                <original>呼びかけられているのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="246" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:08,705</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:12,950</end-time>
                <translation>是作为众人一员而行动的世人自我</translation>
                <original>みんなの一員として振る舞う世人としての自己</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="247" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:14,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:16,613</end-time>
                <translation>而发出呼唤的</translation>
                <original>呼びかけているのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="248" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:16,613</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:20,020</end-time>
                <translation>则是不被世人所支配的本真的自我
世人に支配されない本来的な自己です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="249" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:22,545</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:24,500</end-time>
                <translation>但海德格尔并非在劝说</translation>
                <original>だからといってハイデガー</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="250" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:24,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:27,050</end-time>
                <translation>我们要主动发出良心的呼唤</translation>
                <original>は良心の呼び声を自ら発して</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="251" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:27,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:31,130</end-time>
                <translation>去做一个有良心的人 并不是这种主张</translation>
                <original>良心的な人になれと説いているのではありません</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="252" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:33,355</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:36,950</end-time>
                <translation>因为良心无法凭自己的意愿控制</translation>
                <original>良心は自分で思うようにコントロールできず</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="253" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:36,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:39,910</end-time>
                <translation>它是不间断地发出的</translation>
                <original>絶え間なく発せられているものだからです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="254" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:42,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:43,807</end-time>
                <translation>打个比方来说</translation>
                <original>例えて言うなら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="255" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:43,807</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:47,725</end-time>
                <translation>就像身处一个持续播放着音乐的房间</translation>
                <original>音楽がかかり続けている部屋にいるような状態</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="256" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:48,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:50,847</end-time>
                <translation>当我们埋头于某项工作时</translation>
                <original>何かの作業に没頭していると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="257" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:50,847</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:54,335</end-time>
                <translation>常常会注意不到音乐吧</translation>
                <original>音楽に気づかないことはよくあることでしょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="258" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:56,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:12:59,750</end-time>
                <translation>要听到那实际上在不断传来的良心呼唤</translation>
                <original>発せられているはずの良心の呼び声を聞くには</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="259" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:12:59,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:02,475</end-time>
                <translation>就需要有一种主动去倾听的态度</translation>
                <original>あえて聞こうとする態度が必要</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="260" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:13:04,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:08,975</end-time>
                <translation>也就是说 我们是忽视良心的呼唤</translation>
                <original>つまり私たちは良心の呼び声を無視するのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="261" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:13:08,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:11,375</end-time>
                <translation>还是侧耳倾听</translation>
                <original>耳を傾けるのかを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="262" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:13:11,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:13,900</end-time>
                <translation>要自己去选择</translation>
                <original>自ら選んでいるというのです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="263" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:13:17,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:21,250</end-time>
                <translation>这种选择去倾听良心呼唤的态度
良心の呼び声を聞こうと選択する態度</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="264" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:13:21,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:24,900</end-time>
                <translation>海德格尔将这选择命名为“决意性”</translation>
                <original>ハイデガーはこの選択を決意性と名付けます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="265" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:13:27,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:31,080</end-time>
                <translation>希望拥有良心的意图中显示出的</translation>
                <original>良心を持とうと意志することに示される</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="266" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:13:31,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:33,575</end-time>
                <translation>现存在的开放状态</translation>
                <original>現存在の開示性は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="267" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:13:33,575</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:35,275</end-time>
                <translation>是此在之中</translation>
                <original>現存在において</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="268" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:13:35,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:39,900</end-time>
                <translation>由其良心所见证的本真的开放状态</translation>
                <original>その良心によって証しされる本来的な開示性であり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="269" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:13:39,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:42,332</end-time>
                <translation>这种杰出的开放状态
この傑出した開示性は</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="270" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:13:42,332</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:45,850</end-time>
                <translation>是向着最固有的有自我谴责的存在
最も固有な負い目ある存在へ向けて</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="271" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:13:45,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:47,300</end-time>
                <translation>在无言中</translation>
                <original>沈黙のうちに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="272" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:13:47,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:51,650</end-time>
                <translation>忍受着不安 为自我筹划</translation>
                <original>不安に耐えながら自らを投企することである</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="273" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <marks>
                    <mark top="">默认标记</mark>
                </marks>
                <start-time>00:13:51,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:54,900</end-time>
                <translation>我们将其称为决意性</translation>
                <original>私たちはこれを決意性と呼ぼう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="274" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:13:57,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:59,649</end-time>
                <translation>刚刚听老师讲到中途还听懂</translation>
                <original>途中まで分かったようだけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="275" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:13:59,649</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:03,475</end-time>
                <translation>但一变成朗读 就能明白这本书有多难了</translation>
                <original>やっぱり朗読ってなるとこの本が難しいってところが分かりますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="276" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:14:03,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:07,650</end-time>
                <translation>-那段文章很难 -虽然野间口老师读得非常慢、非常仔细</translation>
                <original>-あの文章は難しい -沼口さんはすごくゆっくり丁寧に読んでくれてるんだけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="277" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:14:07,650</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:10,925</end-time>
                <translation>但越着听着就迷路了 决意性</translation>
                <original>聞けば聞くほどまた迷子にちょっとなります決意性</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="278" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:14:10,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:13,640</end-time>
                <translation>我们先从刚才朗读的部分开始看吧</translation>
                <original>まずあの朗読部分から見ていきましょうか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="279" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:14:13,640</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:15,200</end-time>
                <translation>老师 请您讲解一下</translation>
                <original>先生解説をお願いいたします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="280" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:14:15,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:17,567</end-time>
                <translation>在这里 海德格尔所说的内容</translation>
                <original>ここでですねハイデーガーが言っていることを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="281" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:14:17,567</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:20,360</end-time>
                <translation>如果用霸凌的例子来说明的话</translation>
                <original>いじめの例を使って説明していくと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="282" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:14:20,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:21,871</end-time>
                <translation>所谓开放状态</translation>
                <original>開示性というのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="283" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:14:21,871</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:26,300</end-time>
                <translation>用一句话来说 就像是看待世界的方式</translation>
                <original>一言で言うと世界の見え方のようなものです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="284" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:14:26,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:29,245</end-time>
                <translation>例如 参与了霸凌的人</translation>
                <original>例えばいじめに加担してしまっている人は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="285" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:14:29,245</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:31,980</end-time>
                <translation>会认为教室里发生霸凌</translation>
                <original>教室の中でいじめが起きるのはしょうがないと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="286" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:14:31,980</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:33,116</end-time>
                <translation>是无可奈何的事</translation>
                <original>仕方のないことなんだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="287" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:14:33,116</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:36,225</end-time>
                <translation>他们就是这样看待世界的</translation>
                <original>というふうに世界を眺めてしまっているわけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="288" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:14:36,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:40,500</end-time>
                <translation>然而 能够倾听良心呼唤的人</translation>
                <original>ところが良心の呼び声に耳を傾けることができた人はですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="289" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:14:40,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:42,725</end-time>
                <translation>他们看待教室的方式就会改变</translation>
                <original>教室の見え方が変わるわけです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="290" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:14:42,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:45,828</end-time>
                <translation>自己其实也可以不参与霸凌吧</translation>
                <original>自分はいじめに加担しないこともできたんじゃないか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="291" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:14:45,828</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:48,750</end-time>
                <translation>他们就能在此时意识到这一点</translation>
                <original>ということにそこで気づくことができるわけですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="292" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:14:48,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:50,300</end-time>
                <translation>在参与了霸凌后的他们</translation>
                <original>いじめに加担してしまった</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="293" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:14:50,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:52,850</end-time>
                <translation>接受自身对霸凌的谴责的同时</translation>
                <original>その負い目を引き受けながらですね</original>
