                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="309" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:15:28,620</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:30,775</end-time>
                <translation>在日语中 我觉得它有一种</translation>
                <original>一つのことにグッと集中するみたいな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="310" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:15:30,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:32,809</end-time>
                <translation>像是集中精力于一件事</translation>
                <original>視野を狭めるみたいなニュアンスが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="311" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:15:32,809</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:34,225</end-time>
                <translation>或是视野变窄的语感</translation>
