            <t index="317" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:15:45,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:48,725</end-time>
                <translation>它意味着将之前变得狭窄的视野解放开来</translation>
                <original>それまで狭まっていた視野を解き放ってですね</original>
