            <t index="323" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:16:02,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:05,325</end-time>
                <translation>海德格尔从死亡中导出了先驱</translation>
                <original>ハイデガーは死から先駆</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="324" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:16:05,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:08,600</end-time>
                <translation>从良心中导出了决意性</translation>
                <original>良心からは決意性を導き出しました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="325" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:16:08,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:11,750</end-time>
                <translation>从这里开始 海德格尔将如何推进他的论述呢？</translation>
                <original>ここからはハイデガーはどのように論を進めるのでしょうか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="326" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:16:11,750</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:13,460</end-time>
                <translation>此在究竟是如何</translation>
                <original>現存在がどのようにして</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="327" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:16:13,460</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:16,680</end-time>
                <translation>从非本真性中取回本真性的呢？
