                <start-time>00:16:28,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:32,225</end-time>
                <translation>在根源上是在不安中展开的</translation>
                <original>根源的には不安のうちに開示されている</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="334" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:16:32,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:34,440</end-time>
                <translation>然而决意性</translation>
                <original>ところが決意性は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="335" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:16:34,440</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:39,375</end-time>
                <translation>试图将这种根源性的不安 化为己有</translation>
                <original>この根源的な不安を自らのものとすることを試みるのである</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="336" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:16:40,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:42,900</end-time>
                <translation>这种根源性的不安
この根源的な不安は</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="337" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:16:42,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:47,625</end-time>
                <translation>会清除包裹着此在的一切遮蔽</translation>
                <original>現存在を包むあらゆる隠蔽を取り払う</original>
                <spell/>
