            <t index="340" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:16:55,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:58,225</end-time>
                <translation>没有人会告诉我们正确答案</translation>
                <original>誰も正解を教えてくれないし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="341" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:16:58,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:01,350</end-time>
                <translation>人生没有什么是确知的</translation>
                <original>何も確かなことはないのが人生</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="342" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:17:01,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:06,250</end-time>
                <translation>但是决意选择自己的人生</translation>
                <original>しかし自分自身の人生を選び取るのだと決意すること</original>
