            <t index="348" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:17:26,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:29,250</end-time>
                <translation>拥有良心的意愿</translation>
                <original>良心を持とうと意思する</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="349" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:17:31,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:34,500</end-time>
                <translation>感觉我好像有点明白了</translation>
                <original>何かちょっと俺に入ってきた気がする</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="350" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:17:34,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:38,350</end-time>
                <translation>我在做一个采访了很多残奥运动员的节目</translation>
                <original>パラアスリートたちにいっぱいインタビューさせてもらう番組をやっていて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="351" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:17:38,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:40,700</end-time>
                <translation>有个曾经是职业单板滑雪运动员的人</translation>
                <original>自分がスノーボーダーのプロなのに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="352" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:17:40,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:46,700</end-time>
                <translation>亲眼看着自己的右脚在自己面前被压烂</translation>
                <original>目の前で自分の右足が潰れていくっていうのを 見たところから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="353" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:17:46,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:50,320</end-time>
                <translation>从那一刻起 他就开始想接下来自己还能做些什么了</translation>
                <original>さあ自分に後何ができるっていう話が始まる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="354" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:17:50,320</start-time>
                <end-time>00:17:53,675</end-time>
