                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="358" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:18:02,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:03,800</end-time>
                <translation>海德格尔</translation>
                <original>ハイデガーは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="359" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:18:03,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:18:07,375</end-time>
                <translation>将先驱与决意性合为一体的此在的存在方式
