            <t index="429" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:08,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:11,320</end-time>
                <translation>他是把这两点放在一起考虑的</translation>
                <original>そこを彼はセットで考えているということですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="430" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:13,620</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:15,880</end-time>
                <translation>话说回来 我们学到 人这种此在</translation>
                <original>ところで人間という現存在は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="431" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:15,880</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:18,725</end-time>
                <translation>是存在者之一</translation>
                <original>存在者の中の一つと教わりました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="432" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:18,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:20,720</end-time>
                <translation>之后会深入探讨其他存在者 </translation>
                <original>この後他の存在者ですとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="433" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:20,720</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:24,300</end-time>
                <translation>以及“存在是什么” 这类根源性问题吗？</translation>
                <original>じゃ存在とは何かという 根源的な問いに迫っていくんでしょうか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="434" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:24,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:25,500</end-time>
                <translation>对啊对啊 想起来了</translation>
                <original>そうだそうだそういうことですよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="435" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:25,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:27,960</end-time>
                <translation>-这才是重点啊 -本来是为了思考“存在”本身 </translation>
                <original>-そこですよね -存在というものを考えるために</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="436" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:27,960</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:31,275</end-time>
                <translation>才先把人区分出来 称为“此在”的嘛</translation>
                <original>一旦人間を分けて現存在ってやってきたんですもんね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="437" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:31,275</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:33,135</end-time>
                <translation>其实啊 很遗憾 </translation>
                <original>実はですね残念ながら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="438" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:33,135</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:35,040</end-time>
                <translation>到这里就结束了</translation>
                <original>ここで終わりになってしまうんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="439" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:35,040</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:37,173</end-time>
                <translation>本来应该是有除此在的
現存在以外のものを含む</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="440" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:37,173</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:39,625</end-time>
                <translation>深入讨论“存在”本身</translation>
                <original>存在そのものに迫ってこそですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="441" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:39,625</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:42,545</end-time>
                <translation>才能到达“存在是什么”这一问题的答案</translation>
                <original>存在とは何かという問いの答えに到達できる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="442" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:42,545</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:44,050</end-time>
                <translation>本该如此的</translation>
                <original>はずだったんですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="443" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:44,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:46,415</end-time>
                <translation>然而这样的讨论正要开始时</translation>
                <original>そうした議論がこれから始まりそうだと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="444" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:46,415</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:48,550</end-time>
                <translation>读者感受到这点时</translation>
                <original>読者に予感させるところで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="445" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:48,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:51,350</end-time>
                <translation>《存在与时间》便戛然而止了</translation>
                <original>存在と時間は終わってしまいます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="446" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:51,350</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:52,725</end-time>
                <translation>是啊 有这么个前提呢</translation>
                <original>そうです言ってましたね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="447" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:52,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:54,690</end-time>
                <translation>你连一本书都没出</translation>
                <original>お前本の一冊も出さないで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="448" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:54,690</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:56,220</end-time>
                <translation>想有正教授 不可能</translation>
                <original>就職無理だぞって言われて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="449" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:56,220</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:57,400</end-time>
                <translation>所以他就赶快写了本</translation>
                <original>じゃあ急いで書きますって言ったら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="450" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:57,400</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:59,800</end-time>
                <translation>虽然只写了一半 但总之先出版</translation>
                <original>まだ半分しか書けないけどとりあえず一冊</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="451" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:21:59,800</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:01,080</end-time>
                <translation>好想讲了这个事</translation>
                <original>みたいなこと言ってましたね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="452" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:01,080</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:04,380</end-time>
                <translation>不过 海德格尔真正厉害的地方在于</translation>
                <original>ただですねハイデガーのやはり恐るべき点は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="453" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:04,380</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:06,925</end-time>
                <translation>他凭借这本未完成的著作</translation>
                <original>こうした未完成な本によって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="454" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:06,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:10,850</end-time>
                <translation>完全决定了此后哲学的走向</translation>
                <original>その後の哲学の行く末を 完全に決定してしまった</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="455" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:10,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:11,874</end-time>
                <translation>打个比方来说</translation>
                <original>例えて言うと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="456" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:11,874</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:15,740</end-time>
                <translation>那座“米洛的维纳斯”的雕塑 它没有双臂</translation>
                <original>両腕がないミロのビーナスという彫刻がありますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="457" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:15,740</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:17,450</end-time>
                <translation>如果说缺少了手臂</translation>
                <original>腕が欠けていることが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="458" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:17,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:19,975</end-time>
                <translation>是否就损害了这件作品的魅力呢</translation>
                <original>じゃあこの作品の魅力を損なっているかというと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="459" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:19,975</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:21,525</end-time>
                <translation>我认为并非如此</translation>
                <original>そうではないと思うんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="460" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:21,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:23,880</end-time>
                <translation>不如说 正因为有残缺的部分</translation>
                <original>むしろ欠けているところがあるからこそ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="461" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:23,880</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:26,600</end-time>
                <translation>我们才会对这件作品浮想联翩</translation>
                <original>その作品に思いを馳せてしまったりとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="462" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:26,600</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:30,825</end-time>
                <translation>或者说 它有着让人得以发挥想象的一面吧</translation>
                <original>想像を膨らませることが できる側面もあるのではないかなと思っています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="463" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:30,825</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:33,500</end-time>
                <translation>用这么通俗的比喻真是不好意思</translation>
                <original>もう本当に柔らかい例えで申し訳ないけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="464" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:33,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:36,960</end-time>
                <translation>就像那部超人气漫画因作者绝笔而完结</translation>
                <original>その大人気漫画が絶筆によって終わってしまったりとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="465" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:36,960</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:39,325</end-time>
                <translation>或是连载的周刊本身停刊了</translation>
                <original>週刊時自体がなくなっちゃったりとかして</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="466" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:39,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:42,580</end-time>
                <translation>反而极大地激发了读者的想象力</translation>
                <original>とてつもない想像力を書き立てられたり</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="467" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:42,580</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:44,150</end-time>
                <translation>甚至说不定</translation>
                <original>下手すると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="468" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:44,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:46,520</end-time>
                <translation>会有人因为想画它的后续</translation>
                <original>それの続き的なことが書きたくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="469" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:46,520</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:49,900</end-time>
                <translation>而最终成为了职业漫画家</translation>
                <original>プロの漫画家になっていく人がいたりとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="470" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:49,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:52,140</end-time>
                <translation>这本书就是这样的存在</translation>
                <original>この本はそういう存在なんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="471" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:52,140</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:53,250</end-time>
                <translation>是的</translation>
                <original>はい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="472" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:53,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:57,900</end-time>
                <translation>所以 那些对海德格尔进行学术研究的人</translation>
                <original>ですのでハイデガーを学術的に研究している人たちというのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="473" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:57,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:22:59,955</end-time>
                <translation>对于海德格尔之后究竟描绘了</translation>
                <original>ハイデガーはこの先どんな結論を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="474" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:22:59,955</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:01,780</end-time>
                <translation>怎样的结论</translation>
                <original>描いていたのだろうかというのをですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="475" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:01,780</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:04,325</end-time>
                <translation>通过他当时的讲座</translation>
                <original>当時の彼の講義ですとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="476" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:04,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:06,550</end-time>
                <translation>以及阅读各种文献</translation>
                <original>そして様々な文献を読んで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="477" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:06,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:08,875</end-time>
                <translation>试图设法将其重构出来</translation>
                <original>何とか再構成しようとすると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="478" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:08,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:11,725</end-time>
                <translation>都在拼命地做着这样的工作</translation>
                <original>いうことを一生懸命やっていますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="479" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:11,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:13,075</end-time>
                <translation>那可真厉害</translation>
                <original>それすごいな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="480" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:14,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:16,875</end-time>
                <translation>伊集院 第3回感觉如何？</translation>
                <original>伊集院さん第3回いかがでしたか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="481" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:16,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:20,500</end-time>
                <translation>能从世人解放出来的是“死亡”</translation>
                <original>世人から解放されるのは死ですよって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="482" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:20,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:23,200</end-time>
                <translation>当时第2回结尾听到这话时</translation>
                <original>その第2回目の後に言われた時は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="483" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:23,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:26,875</end-time>
                <translation>我本以为这会聊成个多么沉重的话题啊</translation>
                <original>どんなどんよりとした話になるんだろうと思ったんですけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="484" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:26,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:31,125</end-time>
                <translation>但听了却有些豁然开朗</translation>
                <original>何か今僕はちょっと晴れやかな気持ちになっているし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="485" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:31,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:32,988</end-time>
                <translation>把心中想要哪天再讲的话</translation>
                <original>いつか言おうと思っていることを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="486" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:32,988</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:34,950</end-time>
                <translation>现在就说出来的重要性</translation>
                <original>今言うことの大切さとか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="487" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:34,950</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:38,125</end-time>
                <translation>我今天回去时会重新回味回味的</translation>
                <original>ちょっとこうもう一回かみしめながら今日帰りたい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t index="488" torder="1" time="" id="" hasRuby="0" vertical="0">
                <start-time>00:23:41,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:23:43,000</end-time>
                <translation>户谷先生 非常感谢您</translation>
                <original>戸谷さんありがとうございました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
